summer.joffreyballetschool.com/nyc-ballet-intensive/ | Our flagship intensive in New York City taught by our master instructors focuses on classical ballet and contemporary ballet technique, pointe, variations and partnering classes. This Ballet Intensive exposes students to a rigorous and exciting ballet program, a one to seven week summer intensive course which culminates in a student performance at a local theater on the last day of the program. The intensive is intended to provide as much flexibility for a student’s summer schedule as possible. Students are encouraged to attend as many weeks as possible to obtain the greatest benefit from the program. Instruction during both periods is designed to flow seamlessly between the two.